##* {{RQ:John Ford Whore|sig=&#91;F4&#93;|verso=1|page=49|passage=O my belly ſeeths like a Porridge-pot, ſome cold water I ſhall boyle ouer elſe; my whole body is in a ſweat, that you may '''wring''' my ſhirt; feele here— {{...}}}}
