##* {{RQ:Coverdale Bible|Judges|6|38|folio=xvi|column=1|passage=And whan he roſe vp early on the morow, he '''wrãge''' [wrange] y&#868; dew out of the [[fleece|fleſe]], and fylled a dyſſhe full of water.}}
