##* {{RQ:Smollett Roderick Random|volume=I|chapter=XIV|page=107|passage=[He] '''wrung''' the urine out of his perriwig, and lifting up a large ſtone, flung it with ſuch force againſt the ſtreet-door of that house from whence he had been bedewed, that the lock giving way, it flew wide open, {{...}}}}
